  <!-- EN: rallied -->
  <UMW_Rallied.label>士气大振</UMW_Rallied.label>

  <!-- EN: Stirred by a rallying cry. For a time, pain is dulled and staggering blows are quickly shaken off. -->
  <UMW_Rallied.description>受到鼓舞呐喊的激励。一段时间内，疼痛会减轻，受到攻击后也能很快从抑止状态中恢复。</UMW_Rallied.description>


  <!-- EN: sedative buildup -->
  <UMW_SedativeBuildup.label>镇静剂积聚</UMW_SedativeBuildup.label>

  <!-- EN: A fast-acting sedative building up in the bloodstream. At high levels it renders creatures unconscious. -->
  <UMW_SedativeBuildup.description>一种在血液中不断积聚的速效镇静剂。浓度过高时会使生物失去知觉。</UMW_SedativeBuildup.description>

